  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To generate short-term employment while addressing urgent rural irrigation, drainage and water infrastructure rehabilitation needs.This will be achieved through a flexible program of labor-intensive civil works to restore and improve rural water supply and irrigation infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
